Z||000013||Pontiaddict||02-01-2001||11:19 PM||||Microsoft announced that the X-box will be Dreamcast(which happens to run off of a version of Windows CE) compatable.<P>I don't think the PS2 is all that everyone thinks it is. The graphics aren't that impressive, it takes forever for anything to load, and most of games are ported versions of the original Playstation games. Midnight club comes to mind. Not only is it the same as the PS1 version, it's also Microsofts own Midtown Madness (rebadged), with outdated gameplay and car physics. I won't get started on the stupid controller design that Sony has. <P>I guess you can tell that I'm not a Playstation fan.||||reg||1
